# Next to the Dockerfile, so it applies with either build context (the repo root or this folder); hence the **/ patterns.
**/.git
**/.superpowers
**/node_modules
**/public/js
**/public/app.css
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
# Your day files are mounted at run time, never baked into the image.
**/days
# Building from the repo root: leave out the other apps.
apps/*
!apps/timeblock
